      "extract": "Introduction Drinfeld’s work on quasitriangular quasi-Hopf algebras appeared (in english) in 1990. Its impact on elucidating the conceptual foundations of the deformation of semi-simple Lie algebras cannot be overestimated. By relaxing coassociativity, one perceives, through Drinfeld’s work, both the classical and the deformed algebras to belong to the same “space”, with a universal twist element F eﬀecting the",
